Lupo. come on. man! Just don't...

122
00:10:50.931 --> 00:10:52.058
- You didn't see nothing!
- [boy] Calm down. Lupo.

123
00:10:52.141 --> 00:10:53.645
[second boy] Hey. chill. man.

124
00:10:53.728 --> 00:10:55.064
